{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Eightfold.HyperbolicVolumeFormType","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Eightfold.HyperbolicVolumeFormType","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Choose.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.HyperbolicVolumeFormType.complex_three_real_extCube","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.HyperbolicVolumeFormType.complex_three_real_extCube","kind":"theorem","line":200,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/HyperbolicVolumeFormType.lean#L200-L204","doc":"For contrast: a complex rank-3 object has real rank 6, whose `Λ³` is\n**twenty**-dimensional, not a line.  The complex `Λ³_ℂ` that the eightfold needs\nis not the real `Λ³_ℝ` of the same bundle — a further reason the two threes\ncannot be identified. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.HyperbolicVolumeFormType.degree_three_but_real_rank_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.HyperbolicVolumeFormType.degree_three_but_real_rank_three","kind":"theorem","line":193,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/HyperbolicVolumeFormType.lean#L193-L198","doc":"**The third pair of different threes, stated side by side.**  The hyperbolic\nvolume form has degree 3 — genuinely — while the object it is a top form of has\n*real* rank 3, and the eightfold way needs *complex* rank 3, i.e. real rank 6. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.HyperbolicVolumeFormType.realRank_even","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.HyperbolicVolumeFormType.realRank_even","kind":"theorem","line":188,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/HyperbolicVolumeFormType.lean#L188-L191","doc":"The complex rank a real rank-3 object would have to have is not an integer —\n`3` is odd, and every complex bundle has even real rank. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.HyperbolicVolumeFormType.real_three_not_complex_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.HyperbolicVolumeFormType.real_three_not_complex_three","kind":"theorem","line":181,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/HyperbolicVolumeFormType.lean#L181-L186","doc":"Restated as the exclusion: a real rank-3 object is not the underlying real\nbundle of any complex rank-3 object. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.HyperbolicVolumeFormType.three_ne_six","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.HyperbolicVolumeFormType.three_ne_six","kind":"theorem","line":178,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/HyperbolicVolumeFormType.lean#L178-L179","doc":"The two are different, which is the whole content of the trap. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.HyperbolicVolumeFormType.complexRank_three_is_realRank_six","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.HyperbolicVolumeFormType.complexRank_three_is_realRank_six","kind":"theorem","line":175,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/HyperbolicVolumeFormType.lean#L175-L176","doc":"**But its object is real rank 3, and complex rank 3 is real rank 6.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.HyperbolicVolumeFormType.real_three_has_volume_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.HyperbolicVolumeFormType.real_three_has_volume_form","kind":"theorem","line":170,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/HyperbolicVolumeFormType.lean#L170-L173","doc":"**A real 3-manifold's tangent bundle has a genuine degree-3 volume form.**\n`Λ³` of a real rank-3 bundle is a line — so the hyperbolic volume form really is\na volume form, and the route was not a category error on that count. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.HyperbolicVolumeFormType.extPowerDim","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.HyperbolicVolumeFormType.extPowerDim","kind":"def","line":167,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/HyperbolicVolumeFormType.lean#L167-L168","doc":"The dimension of `Λ^k` of a real rank-`m` bundle. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.HyperbolicVolumeFormType.realRank_of_complexRank","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.HyperbolicVolumeFormType.realRank_of_complexRank","kind":"def","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/HyperbolicVolumeFormType.lean#L164-L165","doc":"The real rank underlying a complex rank-`n` bundle. ","signatureChunk":0}]}